<title>USA: Ventana president to resign.</title>
<headline>Ventana president to resign.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ventana Medical Systems Inc said Wednesday its President and Chief Executive R James Danehy plans to resign once a replacement for him has been found.</p>
<p>The company said Danehy decided not to relocate from his residence in the Chicago area to the company's headquarters in Tucson for family and personal reasons.</p>
<p>Danehy will will remain on the board of directors to ensure a smooth transition of leadership. The company said in a statement it expects the search to take between 6 and 18 months to complete.</p>
